# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Below, we construct the dynamic circuit for the Trotterized time evolution. "
"The `RZZ` gates are replaced with the dynamic circuit implementation using "
"the steps described above.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa ibaba, binubuo natin ang dynamic circuit para sa Trotterized time "
